{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 18, :comments ["<b>And the fat of My chagai shall not remain.</b> The fats of the Paschal offering." "<b>Until morning.</b> Just as the body of the Paschal offering itself, concerning which it is stated: ולא תותירו ממנו עד בקר." "<b>Chagai.</b> My sacrifices — an analogy: He forbade chag in booths. Above, in the section of Bo, He warned concerning the Paschal offering of Egypt, and here He warned concerning the Paschal offering of the generations."], :book :exodus, :voice :chizkuni, :lang :en, :chapter 23, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-30T15:00:02.480840729Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}